    "en": {
      "trackName": "Puppy Walk",
      "description": "Adopt an adorable virtual puppy to care for and love. Pat them, feed them treats and earn gifts by walking every day.\n\nDigital Dog is a great way to motivate yourself to get out and walk!\n\n* Interact with your puppy by patting, scratching and feeding them treats!\n* Name your puppy and see their name on some dog bowls!\n* Set your step target from 1,000 to 10,000 steps and earn rewards when you reach your goal!\n* Unlock treats, new dog bowl, puppy mats and balls every day!\n* Your puppy will never grow old or die, so rest easy if you miss a day walking!\n* Earn ribbons for achieving special awards for caring for your puppy and walking!\n* Check in every day to earn doggy treats to make your puppy happy!\n* Perfect for all ages!\n* Optional Feature: If you neglect your puppy they may run away, but a short walk will help you find them! Turn this on under the settings.\n* Uses HealthKit to measure your steps.\n* For Apple Watch and iPhone\n\nThanks,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "releaseNotes": "This update changes from free to paid - which means no more ads!\nFor iPhone users you will get free treats every day, as well as unlocking new bowls, mats and balls.\n\nEnjoy,\nJohnno",
